= The Volksmark question

We still have a long way to go before we can adopt a new currency Decoupled from gold. 

- @increase_support: Increase support.
- @volksmark: Adopt the Volksmark.
- @root: Do nothing.

@volksmark
choose-if: devaluation_progress >= 2 and z_relation >= 40 and ddp_relation >= 50
on-arrival: volksmark = 1; inflation = 5; hyperinflation = 0; economic_growth = 1; month_actions += 1;
subtitle: [? if devaluation_progress < 2 : Decoupling the Volksmark from gold is not feasible yes, more work needs to be done convincing the party. ?] [? if z_relation < 40 : The Zentrum are not convinced of the benefits of a new currency. ?] [? if ddp_relation < 50 : The DDP are weary of the initiative. ?]

Finally, after support from our party, and our coalition partners, we can adopt a new currency, the Volksmark, which is completely decoupled from gold.

@increase_support
view-if: devaluation_progress < 2
on-arrival: devaluation_progress += 1; month_actions += 1;

We are working on increasing the acceptance of a new currency, unpegged to gold. This will take time, and is as of now, theoretical work, however the benefits of a new currency are clear, as it will allow us to have more control over our monetary policy.

@root
view-if: devaluation_progress < 2